From 9aa417d86596acf76da232adaa4c26bba3acb2da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 18:43:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] LV6a: reserved demon ids, nine AI flags, demon skins, 31
 boss rows, Boss Rush sets

Four reserved base demon ids (old sprites), IS_DEMON as two ranges, the
DemonSkin table (12 skins), the nine AI flags as one bit test per AI tick
(ai_st folds ai_flash and ai_los: RAM net zero), lv_boss at 31 rows with LBM_*
mechanic ids and 16-bit flags, Library skin entries, Boss Rush set tables.
Not built on the PS1 (FOES_NEW). A host test per AI flag.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Xd63cvXV9YcGJn2CBo4zvt
